  Mirandized at Washington County Sheriff's Office
  Robinson was read his Miranda rights at 6:25 PM on
  September 11, 2025, inside the Washington County Sheriff's
  Office (WCSO) in Hurricane, Utah. Defense filings and the
  WCSO video exhibit (Bates 3996-R1/R2) document that
  timestamp, showing him in a "soft interview" room with family
  present before he was later transferred to Utah County.
  How it fits the custody timeline
  • ~9 PM 9/11 - Investigator testimony says Robinson arrived
  at the WCSO with his parents and a family friend.
  • 6:25PM 9/11 - Miranda rights read and custody log
  recorded at WCSO.
  • 10 PM 9/11 - Utah County booking sheet entry (separate
  jurisdiction).
  • 04:009/12 - Utah County affidavit lists formal arrest time
  after transport to the Utah County Jail.
  So the Miranda occurred in Washington County, not Utah
  County, and it predates the later booking/affidavit times.
